WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:07.880
Kurgan the Crafty: Warriors! Today I will address you all.

2
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:12.880
Kurgan the Crafty: We've been waiting for a long time. We believed!

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Kurgan the Crafty: And he came.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Kurgan the Crafty: He made us rich.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.840
Kurgan the Crafty: He defeated the most powerful enemies.

6
00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:32.840
Kurgan the Crafty: he's proven he's stronger than Uro-Boros!

7
00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:40.440
Kurgan the Crafty: He is Skulnar the Fierce, the reborn Legendary Orc and our leader! Chief, a speech for your people!

8
00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:45.440
Skulnar the Fierce: Ugh... Strength and freedom!

9
00:00:53.920 --> 00:01:00.440
Landfill Warriors: Chief! Freedom and strength! Freedom and strength!

10
00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:05.440
Fury the Fierce: ...And the Hero of Sarnaut is a new friend of our people!

11
00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.340
Landfill Warriors: Eh... and the Hero of Sarnaut! Freedom and strength!

12
00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:15.340
Landfill Warriors: Freedom and strength! Freedom and strength! Freedom and strength!
